  "comment": "Ep53 Scotland vs Brazil (Group C). SPINE 'The Tartan Army Meets the Hexa' — Scotland's 28-year wait, fate handing them the very team that ended them last time; Brazil chase the Hexa (the 6th star); the Tartan Army sing long after the whistle. MATCH UNPLAYED -> OUR PREDICTION Scotland 0-3 Brazil. THREE goals, all Brazil: Neymar 15' off a Vinicius cross (SCO 0-1 BRA); Vinicius 72' solo from the halfway line past four (SCO 0-2 BRA); Raphinha 85' (SCO 0-3 BRA). Scotland near-miss (NO goal): McTominay finds McGinn 39', whose shot draws a world-class Alisson save (score stays 0-1). vol=0 on every clip (silent reused/AI clips; audio = VO + music + sfx). Atmosphere library: sco-fans, bra-fans, stadium, celebration, mystery-capoeira (the Capoeira Master) + 10 player clips, reused via distinct ids. Scenes reference these ids via <ClipSprite id=...>. Legend 053 = The Capoeira Master (the ginga, the rhythm and soul of Brazilian football — Brazil's first Legend). Brian VO.",
